"name": "Trimble Inc.",
"description": "Trimble, Inc. engages in providing advanced positioning, modeling, and data analytics technologies. It operates through the following segments: AECO, Field Systems, and Transportation & Logistics. The AECO segment serves architects, engineers, contractors, and owners through software and subscription offerings. The Field Systems segment offers hardware and software for survey & mapping and civil construction. The Transportation & Logistics segment provides software and subscription offerings to shippers and carriers. The company was founded by Charles Robert Trimble in 1978 and is headquartered in Westminster, CO.",
